{"status":"question","question":{"text":"This repo is empty, so before I recommend a stack I need the one thing only you can tell me: in plain language, what are we building here? Give me the rough idea — the product, who it's for, and what it should let someone do — and I'll turn it into a concrete foundation recommendation.","recommended":"I can't recommend a stack until I know what the product is — tell me the core idea in a sentence or two (e.g. \"a web app for tracking home energy use\") and I'll lead from there."},"prd":"# Mission: (pending alignment)\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** Establish the project foundation — a running skeleton, a working test system, and one thin vertical slice proving both are connected.\n\n_(PRD in progress — capturing the captain's core idea before recommending a stack.)_"}

